CommitDate: Wed Oct 14 12:33:31 2026 +0200

    coordination: admit reviewed patch-equivalent installation rebases
    
    Configuration master can advance while the installation prepares its other
    integrations. Accept a bounded independent lineage receipt for exact
    patch-equivalent rebases, using the selected runtime comparator and evidence
    reader. Require applied owned coverage and bind the prepared operation to
    the complete reviewed replacement range.
    
    Keep existing plans ancestry-only and preserve ordinary receipt-aware
    execution. Pre-approval lineage contains no fabricated approval record;
    future completion uses the actual submitted job approval. The earlier
    helper remains in history because it already performed live integrations.
    This source-only extension leaves application packaging unchanged.

